      "pronunciationText": "More than six minutes is the part from six up to k. So k minus six, over k, is zero point two five. Then k minus six is a quarter of k, so three quarters of k is six, and k is eight. So P of X less than three is three eighths. Six over k equals zero point two five is wrong. That's the chance of less than six minutes, and it gives k equals twenty-four."
